ensions, compression, retina assets, thumbnails, and metadata"}, {"id": "1e57f115-8c9c-4445-96e1-83e6943bddcf", "type": "concept", "title": "Social platform sizes, responsive images, accessibility, file-size limits, and compression artifacts"}, {"id": "7605de52-3581-4621-99dd-801307cbb9d4", "type": "concept", "title": "Testing exports on multiple screens and in real upload contexts"}], "description": "Digital delivery requires balancing quality, speed, compatibility, and platform constraints."}, {"id": "8d992c7e-b509-4ede-a681-ce1fb2f696d2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Quality control and archiving", "children": [{"id": "4053f968-4745-4be1-a453-37e2d7a31349", "type": "concept", "title": "Export checklists, spelling, visible artifacts, color shifts, missing fonts, wrong dimensions, and flattened copies"}, {"id": "d75fbe87-cc08-4494-a8c4-6afc4b1a3a1e", "type": "concept", "title": "Working files, master files, delivery files, previews, contact sheets, and archive folders"}, {"id": "1b361c82-f355-4d1c-9b14-2af9fffe9dfe", "type": "concept", "title": "Metadata, version history, licensing notes, and portfolio documentation"}], "description": "Final delivery should be checked, named, and archived so work can be reused later."}]}, {"id": "aad24ce4-8ec4-4ecb-9b05-df0945de951c", "type": "topic", "title": "Critique, Iteration, Documentation, and Portfolio Presentation", "description": "Use critique and process documentation to refine work and present digital imaging decisions professionally.", "children": [{"id": "1e82bfc2-1241-400d-9e8f-1ddbf6e2e52b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Critique methods", "children": [{"id": "5a6db69a-89fd-4273-885f-d7eb1d8c38cf", "type": "concept", "title": "Descriptive, analytical, interpretive, and evaluative feedback"}, {"id": "0beb2c28-d0df-44a1-9ce9-bf000122e9be", "type": "concept", "title": "Discussing composition, color, tone, mask quality, image credibility, hierarchy, and concept"}, {"id": "93c12072-4fc2-40d7-894b-97d861e20227", "type": 